# Replay is mandatory

Any capture entrypoint (`sdr` package or `scripts/worker.py`) must expose `--replay <stem>` loading `<stem>.npy` + `<stem>.meta.json` as frozen in `docs/interfaces.md`.

Live UHD is optional and must not be required to import the package or run tests.

```text
# BAD
parser.add_argument("--live", required=True)

# GOOD
parser.add_argument("--replay", help="stem of npy+meta.json")
parser.add_argument("--live", action="store_true")
```

Do not implement RF switching across unused UCA elements. Do not skip LO-share checks on `--live`.
